# The names of a callable's parts answer in its code (the author 2026-11-11,
# LMX_blog/2026-11-11.md#callable-parts-visibility; plan M11 5b): the parts are fields of the callable, so a bare args is
# the part args, with its two formals.
fn: f (int: a 1; int: b 2) int
    return: length(args)
end: f
int: seen f()
